        <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
          <name>ImportFromFileOptionPage</name>
          <id>494</id>
          <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
            <name>ImportFromFileOptionNote</name>
            <id>609</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Save the template to a file, open it in a spreadsheet editor, and enter the data.
Then import the spreadsheet to the application. The application supports the following formats:
 • Microsoft Excel 97 Workbook (.xls) or Microsoft Excel 2007 Workbook (.xlsx)
 • LibreOffice Calc Spreadsheet (.ods)
 • Comma-separated values file (.csv)
 • Spreadsheet document (.mxl)</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>الگو را در فایلی ذخیره کرده، آن را در ویرایشگر صفحه‌گسترده باز کنید و داده‌ها را وارد کنید.
سپس صفحه‌گسترده را به برنامه وارد کنید. برنامه از قالب‌های زیر پشتیبانی می‌کند:
 • کارپوشه Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) یا کارپوشه Microsoft Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
 • صفحه‌گسترده LibreOffice Calc (.ods)
 • فایل مقادیر جداشده با ویرگول (.csv)
 • سند صفحه‌گسترده (.mxl)</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Для загрузки данных необходимо сохранить бланк в файл для заполнения в другом приложении. 
Затем загрузить заполненную таблицу в одном из форматов:
• Книги Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) и Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Электронные таблицы LibreOffice Calc (.ods)
• Текст с разделителями (.csv) 
• Табличный документ (.mxl)</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Verileri indirmek için, şablonu başka bir uygulamada doldurmak üzere bir dosyaya kaydetmelisiniz. 
Ardından tamamlanmış elektronik tabloyu aşağıdaki biçimlerden birinde indirin: 
• Microsoft Excel 97 (. xls) ve Excel 2007 (. xlsx)
 çalışma kitapları • LibreOffice Calc elektronik tabloları (. ods)
 • Virgüllü metin (. csv)
 • Tablo belgesi (. mxl)</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Để kết nhập dữ liệu, bạn phải lưu biểu mẫu vào một tệp để điền trong ứng dụng khác. 
Sau đó, kết nhập bảng đã được điền theo một trong các định dạng:
• Bảng Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) và Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
 • Bảng tính LibreScript Calc (.ods) 
• Văn bản được phân tách (.csv) 
• Văn bản dạng bảng (.mxl)</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Save the template to a file, open it in a spreadsheet editor, and enter the data.
Then import the spreadsheet to the application. The application supports the following formats:
 • Microsoft Excel 97 Workbook (.xls) or Microsoft Excel 2007 Workbook (.xlsx)
 • LibreOffice Calc Spreadsheet (.ods)
 • Comma-separated values file (.csv)
 • Spreadsheet document (.mxl)</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Save the template to a file, open it in a spreadsheet editor, and enter the data.
Then import the spreadsheet to the application. The application supports the following formats:
 • Microsoft Excel 97 Workbook (.xls) or Microsoft Excel 2007 Workbook (.xlsx)
 • LibreOffice Calc Spreadsheet (.ods)
 • Comma-separated values file (.csv)
 • Spreadsheet document (.mxl)</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>ImportFromFileOptionNoteExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>611</id>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
            <contextMenu>
              <name>ImportFromFileOptionNoteContextMenu</name>
              <id>610</id>
              <autoFill>true</autoFill>
            </contextMenu>
            <formatted>true</formatted>
            <type>Label</type>
            <height>8</height>
            <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
              <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
            </extInfo>
